     blurbs.j2 — the reusable, field-sized snippets the platform packs paste in.

     Defined ONCE so eJobs, BestJobs and Hipo cannot drift apart from each other
     or from the PDFs. A recruiter who opens two of these surfaces and finds two
     different stories has been given a reason to doubt both.

     Romanian text is written without diacritics, matching the name rule and the
     Romanian CV rendering.
---------------------------------------------------------------------------- -#}

{% macro short_bio_ro() -%}
Inginer software si student la master (Facultatea de Matematica si Informatica, Universitatea din Bucuresti). Livrez software cap-coada — desktop, web si unelte de cercetare — si public codul si datele din spatele cifrelor pe care le raportez.
{%- endmacro %}

{% macro short_bio_en() -%}
Software engineer and master's student at the Faculty of Mathematics and Informatics, University of Bucharest. I ship software end to end — desktop, web and research tooling — and publish the code and data behind the numbers I report.
{%- endmacro %}

